{"intent":"build","plan":"Connect an Arduino Uno to 4 colored LEDs on pins D2 to D5 with 220-ohm resistors, and program it to count from 0 to 15 every 250ms while printing the count to Serial.","reply":"I have set up the Arduino Uno with 4 colored LEDs on pins D2-D5 and programmed a 0-15 binary counter with 250ms intervals and Serial output.","more":false,"clearExisting":true,"board":"half","parts":[{"ref":"U1","type":"uno","props":{"code":"void setup() {
